  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here Hypophosphorus acid is formed as Y and its basicity is 1.<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>NaOH</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mtext>P</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Na</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>P</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mtext>HCl</mtext></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>P</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/zztmytdfrexjiwyjvwydyuoxsodhrxjygiebhhettgqvwktela.jpeg\" /><br />Basicity = 1",
